FFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ae26b09df40ae4e73462416f836e2a1a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NIWAchan_dayo/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eace2ffe/uploads/origins/4364428e-d5ff-451f-9db8-4a8fcb98fe72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cb8d6aa2fdca1923cd166e406f49108", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eace2ffe/uploads/origins/4364428e-d5ff-451f-9db8-4a8fcb98fe72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cb8d6aa2fdca1923cd166e406f49108, https://si.imgix.net/eace2ffe/uploads/origins/4364428e-d5ff-451f-9db8-4a8fcb98fe72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=daaeac9e2cfb916cd8fa336757731c5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eace2ffe/uploads/origins/4364428e-d5ff-451f-9db8-4a8fcb98fe72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=abe191fb69ab58c53b906b4a58587147 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、先生。先生の作品に惹かれ、ぜひ依頼したいと思っています。\n私のOCのイラストをお願いしたいです！\n\n参考文献：https://sta.sh/21p8fh5y190h?edit=1\n過去の自分：https://www.deviantart.com/stash/0ci88jqpk4n\n男性、155cm。\nメガネウサギ。毛色は黒（グレーではない）。うさぎの耳が片方曲がっている。\n上着は某ゲームのものなので、二次創作関連の資料を描きたくない方は脱いでも構いません。(下は白衣を着ている）。\n\n最近記憶喪失になり、過去の自分の記憶が全て消えてしまったキャラクターです。自分が過去に冷酷な人間だったという知識に苛まれ、悪夢にうなされ、睡眠障害に陥っている。過労にもかかわらず、彼は従業員のためにポジティブな顔を保とうとしている。彼は自分を維持するためにサプリメントやエネルギー補給食品をたくさん食べている。\n彼のパワーのほとんどは天才的な頭脳から来るものだが、身体は極端に弱く、医師によって厳しく監視されている。\n\nダークな雰囲気のものが好みだが、それは君に任せる！自由に描いてください。よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NIWAchan_dayo/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bfa73bd/uploads/origins/79ce65ad-1b4d-47e2-ace0-47fb848af2cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcbe35f7bf8bfb0ade3e448746ff2741", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2bfa73bd/uploads/origins/79ce65ad-1b4d-47e2-ace0-47fb848af2cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcbe35f7bf8bfb0ade3e448746ff2741, https://si.imgix.net/2bfa73bd/uploads/origins/79ce65ad-1b4d-47e2-ace0-47fb848af2cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c5267c45dc7d8ff5fbc8686c880ffff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2bfa73bd/uploads/origins/79ce65ad-1b4d-47e2-ace0-47fb848af2cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7524d120bed737f715ed52cedf81c2bb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love the somber mood in some of the pieces you've drawn! If it's okay, I would love to have my OC drawn in your style!\n\nMy character's concept is a computer program, who is trying his best to adopt 'human' habits / learn 'human' behaviors. He is usually neutral, so please draw him however you'd like!\n\nIn the reference link, please refer to 'NEW DESIGN / 新しいデザイン' for his clothing - or, you can also dress him however you'd like - I'm okay with anything!\n\nI'll leave the pose and composition up to you, so please feel free to do what you'd like!\n\nThere are some references within the folder marked with '★' as well, I think these pieces convey his 'energy' well, so please refer to these for inspiration if you need it!\n\nSome important character details:\nEyeglasses (optional, but preferred)\nEar piercings\nBarcode tattoo on neck\nHis eye color is black\nHis haircut is an undercut, so it is very short in the back.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_nEs1-q9z-DWkInxlR3Q9u_Ar313nrEs?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NIWAchan_dayo/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5b96320/uploads/origins/190c72c2-7760-4424-ba5a-85ea7337941a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a5dfc6172dbc0043f87f0512b79b2dc8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e5b96320/uploads/origi